.TH JSON2REC "1" "April 2026" "GNU recutils 1.9.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
json2rec \- json to rec converter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B json2rec
[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]... [\fI\,JSON_FILE\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert JSON data into rec data.
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-type\fR=\fI\,TYPE\/\fR
type name for the converted records; if this
parameter is omitted then the type is inferred
from the JSON structure.
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
print a help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show version and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Convert a JSON array of objects to rec format:

  json2rec contacts.json

Convert JSON with a specific record type:

  json2rec -t Contact contacts.json

Pipe from curl for JSON-to-rec conversion:

  curl -s https://api.example.com/users | json2rec
